WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:07.510
Aki Izayoi, you enjoy the 
power of destruction.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.880
You feel joy from that power.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:16.330
I enjoy destruction?

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:45.390
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:50.410
That's deeply engraved into us

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:58.960
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:04.900
Break through even further

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:10.440
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:17.570
There's always only one truth

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:21.410
So feel the voice of your heart

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:26.230
With your unwavering emotions

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:32.260
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:07.540
Victim Sanctuary
Become the Star that Envelops Destruction!  Stardust Dragon

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:28.960
My turn.

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.130
I draw!

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:33.320
I activate the Continuous Spell Ivy Shackles.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:40.100
During my turn, I can turn all monsters 
on your field into Plant-Type monsters.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:45.570
I change your Shield Warrior 
from Warrior-Type to Plant-Type.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:50.330
Next is Rose Tentacles's monster effect.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:54.390
When the Battle Phase begins, 
for every Plant-Type monster

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:59.390
on your field, it increases the 
number of times it can attack.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:04.510
Therefore, Rose Tentacles can attack twice.

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:08.030
Rose Tentacles attacks Shield Warrior!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.580
Thorn Whip!

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.970
Shield Warrior is currently Plant-Type.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:21.830
When Rose Tentacles destroys a Plant-Type 
monster, you take 300 points of damage.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.260
So it's true that you enjoy destruction.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.980
Rose Tentacles attacks for a second time!

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.320
It attacks you directly!

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.300
I flip over my trap card Card Defense!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:45.090
By discarding one card from my hand, I can 
negate the direct attack from one of your monsters.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:48.070
Afterwards, I get to draw one card.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.810
I end my turn.

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:56.310
Izayoi, you enjoy dealing out pain.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.000
Enough.  What are you talking about?

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.240
My turn.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.050
From my hand, I summon Junk Synchron.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.160
Due to Junk Synchron's monster 
effect, I can Special Summon a

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:16.160
Level 2-or-below monster from my 
graveyard in defense position.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:25.510
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Speed Warrior!

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.460
Synchro Summon!

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.070
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:35.170
Then from my hand, I activate 
the Equip Spell Junk Barrage!

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:37.120
I equip it on to Junk Warrior.

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:40.600
Junk Warrior attacks Rose Tentacles!

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:42.960
Scrap Fist!

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.590
Next is Junk Barrage's effect.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.800
When the equipped monster 
destroys a monster in battle,

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.800
you take damage equal to half 
that monster's attack points.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:05.990
I end my turn.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.540
Izayoi took a lot of damage!

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:11.990
That's why this is the finals!  No 
one knows what's going to happen!

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.910
Defeat the black rose witch!

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.420
Defeat the witch!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.600
Wow!  He took away 1000 
life points in an instant!

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.400
Cool!

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:21.240
Yusei won't allow himself 
to keep getting beaten up.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:23.130
This is getting interesting.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:27.650
You're wrong.  Yusei isn't just battling.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:29.800
There's something about her…

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.090
My turn.  I draw!

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:36.770
Due to the effect of the Continuous Spell Ivy

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.770
Shackles, Junk Warrior changes 
from Warrior-Type to Plant-Type.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:43.280
I summon the Tuner Monster Copy Plant!

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:53.680
Once a turn, Copy Plant selects one Plant-Type 
monster on the field and becomes the same Level.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.460
Copy Junk Warrior's Level!

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:04.900
What's she planning to do if she's 
only going to copy its Level?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.530
Don't you know?

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.770
I activate the monster effect 
of Dark Verger in my graveyard.

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:16.950
When a Plant-Type Tuner Monster is summoned, 
I can Special Summon it from the graveyard.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:20.430
The total Level is 7.  That 
means that dragon is coming!

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:26.640
Level 5 Copy Plant tunes Level 2 Dark Verger!

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:32.920
The cold flame envelops the entire world.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:35.440
Black flower, bloom!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.320
Synchro Summon!

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:40.620
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:47.900
Black Rose Dragon's monster effect.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:53.570
By removing one Plant-Type monster 
in my graveyard from play,

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:57.570
one of your monster's attack 
points become 0 during this turn.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:00.030
I remove Wall of Ivy from play.

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:02.990
Rose Restriction!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.090
Junk Warrior!

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.710
Black Rose Dragon attacks Junk Warrior!

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.650
Black Rose Flare!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.610
I activate Shield Warrior's 
monster effect from my graveyard!

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:22.300
By removing this card in my graveyard from play, it 
negates the destruction of my monster due to battle!

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.940
However, you still take battle damage.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:28.680
I flip over my trap card!  Spirit Force!

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:32.590
For one time only, the battle 
damage I take becomes 0!

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.920
Due to Spirit Force's 
effect, one monster in my

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:41.920
graveyard with 1500-or-fewer defense 
points is added to my hand.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.350
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:47.350
You witch!

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:48.850
Go home and disappear!

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.140
Return to your witch's nest!

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:52.930
Defeat the witch!  Hang the witch!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.150
You witch!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:55.880
What are you doing, witch?

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:57.210
Witch, vanish!

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:57.870
Witch!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.000
That's right.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.730
You're exactly right.

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:03.800
I'm a witch.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.800
I'm a scary girl who enjoys dealing out pain.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:12.600
I enjoy it.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:20.730
I really enjoy using my power to deal pain 
to everyone who pushed me into isolation!

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:23.370
She's enjoying this.

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:27.670
However, within that joy, she's...

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:30.780
My turn!

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:33.950
Prevention Star.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.890
By equipping this card on 
a monster that switches to

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:38.890
defense position, it prevents my 
opponent's monster from moving.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.310
If this keeps up...

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.860
I summon Junk Synchron from my hand!

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:49.540
Due to Junk Synchron's monster 
effect, I summon Speed Warrior!

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.000
He did it!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:59.460
Speed Warrior's attack points are added to 
Junk Warrior's, so it has 3200 attack points!

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.210
That's Power of Fellows.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:05.670
Lend me your power.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:10.860
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 5 Junk Warrior!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:18.160
The wishes come together to form a new 
shining star!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:19.780
Synchro Summon!

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:22.620
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:32.940
This is the first time I've seen this dragon!

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.090
What an incredible sight!

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:41.100
That's Bro's Signer dragon?

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:45.320
Why did he do that?  Junk 
Warrior had more attack points!

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:49.120
Yusei is trying to do 
something during this duel.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.150
What?

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.640
Wonderful.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.450
This is…

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.750
This is a detestable mark.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.300
I despise this mark.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:43.410
If I didn't have this power, I…

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.890
You wouldn't have felt joy from power.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.680
You would not have gained 
pleasure from people's pain.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.800
That's right.

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:58.480
This mark is a detestable symbol carved into 
me by a monster that surpasses humanity.

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:01.270
That's why I hate myself.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:05.660
I can't hold back my feelings of destruction.

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:08.690
I felt that I shouldn't be allowed to live.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:17.330
However, the stronger those feelings became, the 
more it transformed into impulses for destruction.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:21.000
So I stopped being me.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.870
I created another version of myself.

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:34.640
My masked version wasn't me.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:39.500
I didn't care if I enjoyed 
destruction and laughed at pain.

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:48.620
That's when Divine taught me that I didn't 
need a mask and I should just be me.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.980
Those words saved me.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:56.800
I'm fine as long as I remain alive.  
I won't think of anything anymore.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.530
I'll just only feel.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.690
You have to think for yourself!

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:04.490
I don't care.  Divine will think for me.

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:06.320
Don't run from your problems, Izayoi!

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:08.710
It can't be helped.

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:11.740
There's nothing I can do.

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:15.280
Yes there is!  There's a version of 
you who doesn't approve of your joy!

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:18.280
As long as those feelings 
exist, you can start over!

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:21.260
You can save yourself!

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.550
Be quiet.

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:27.830
I will reach her heart in this duel.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:31.950
Stardust Dragon attacks Black Rose Dragon!

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.600
Luca?  Your arm?

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:49.620
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:00.710
I'll just only feel.

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:05.070
I'll feel pain and strife from you.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:07.280
She's a witch!

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:08.420
She's a real witch!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:17.560
Aki, you really are a bad girl.

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:26.070
Izayoi.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.970
My turn.  I draw.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.630
I activate Magic Planter.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:38.300
By sending a Continuous Spell on the field to 
the graveyard, I can draw two cards from my deck.

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.680
The Continuous Trap Wicked Rebirth.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:46.940
By paying 800 life points, I can Special 
Summon a Synchro Monster from my graveyard.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:50.930
I resurrect Black Rose Dragon.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:14:01.130
Wicked Rebirth is equipped 
on to Black Rose Dragon.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:05.870
The equipped monster cannot attack this turn.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:11.290
And when the Equip Card is no longer on 
the field, that monster is destroyed.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:15.480
Furthermore, if the equipped monster 
is destroyed due to something

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:19.480
other than this card's effect, then it 
is Special Summoned at the End Phase.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.930
Black Rose Dragon's monster effect.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:27.530
When it is successfully Special Summoned, 
all cards on the field are destroyed.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.190
Black Rose Gale!

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:36.380
It's coming!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:37.580
Everyone, huddle!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.130
Yusei!

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:41.910
This is bad.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.600
I activate Stardust Dragon's monster effect!

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:50.580
By releasing Stardust Dragon, an effect that 
destroys cards is negated and destroyed!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.980
Victim Sanctuary!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:09.800
The two dragons are gone!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.240
He sacrificed Stardust Dragon!

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:15.990
He never changes.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:17.450
I'm not done.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:19.660
I summon Phoenixian Seed.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:23.660
Due to Phoenixian Seed's 
monster effect, I can release

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:27.660
this card to Special Summon 
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:36.410
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis 
attacks Speed Warrior.

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.190
Flame Petal!

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:49.830
After Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis 
attacks, it self-destructs.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.140
Scatter Flame!

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.790
And it deals 800 points of damage.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:04.160
I set one card.

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:10.010
When Stardust Dragon activates its monster 
effect, it resurrects during this turn's End Phase!

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:16.660
Due to the effect of Wicked Rebirth, I

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.660
Special Summon Black Rose 
Dragon during the End Phase!

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:28.090
Then I activate the Continuous 
Trap Overdoom Line.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:33.750
The monster that I Special Summoned from 
my graveyard gains 1000 attack points.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:41.170
Then due to Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis's 
monster effect, it resurrects in defense position.

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:43.510
I end my turn.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.420
My turn.

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:50.920
With this card, when a Dragon-Type 
Synchro Monster on my field

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:55.920
leaves the field, it deals damage 
equal to that monster's attack points.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.670
I switch Stardust Dragon to defense position!

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:07.560
From my hand, I activate the 
Equip Spell Prevention Star.

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:12.430
I can equip it on to a monster when the 
monster switches to defense position.

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:17.080
Once a turn, I can select 
one of your monsters.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.990
That monster cannot attack 
nor change battle position.

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:24.600
I select Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis!

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:29.680
Well done.

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:32.960
If Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis 
attacked him on the

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:36.960
next turn, Yusei would have 
lost due to effect damage.

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:39.650
The trap card Synchro Back.

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:44.190
I return one Synchro Monster 
on my field to the Extra Deck.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.940
I select Black Rose Dragon.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:52.200
Why?

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.500
The Synchro Monster returned 
due to this effect can be

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.500
Special Summoned during the 
Standby Phase of her next turn.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.560
I get it!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.700
She's planning to destroy 
Stardust Dragon by using Black

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:05.700
Rose Dragon's monster effect that 
activates when it's summoned!

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:10.250
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.830
My turn.  I draw.

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:18.040
Due to Synchro Back's effect, 
I resurrect Black Rose Dragon!

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.360
I know you're not enjoying this.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:27.420
Be quiet!

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:29.280
You're in pain, aren't you?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:34.490
Why does this mark throb?

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:38.900
Why am I not enjoying 
this?  Why am I in pain?

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:42.090
The time has come for you to change.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:48.070
The joy of destruction has been 
tormenting you.  And that pain...

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:53.440
That pain is changing to something we 
both share because we have the same mark.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.180
The mark has guided us.

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:58.890
This pain is trying to tell us something.

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:03.730
In order to know the answer, 
you have to think for yourself.

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:08.010
This mark holds the answer!

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:12.820
Don't let others think for you.  
You have to think for yourself.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:16.310
What will a witch like me think about?

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:19.680
As long as Divine guides and 
loves me, that's enough!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:22.630
You're wrong!  You have to love yourself!

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:24.600
If I could do that…

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:26.460
If I could…

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:31.490
I'm in pain because I can't!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:36.260
Black Rose Dragon's monster effect 
activates!  Black Rose Gale!

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:47.120
All cards on the field are destroyed!

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:51.720
I'll keep taking it!  Send 
out all your sadness!

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:53.840
Victim Sanctuary!

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:19.120
The pain is fading…

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:26.860
Now Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis 
is free of Prevention Star's curse!

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:29.610
Your field is wide open.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.680
If I successfully attack you directly, I win!

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:35.050
Everything must vanish.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:36.960
Don't make me think.

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:40.070
You're a detestable foe!

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:42.540
Then why are you crying?

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:48.070
The trap card Cosmic Blast!

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:52.370
When a Dragon-Type Synchro 
Monster leaves my field,

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:56.370
it deals damage equal to that 
monster's attack points!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:15.640
Help me…

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:16.670
Izayoi!

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.430
Serves you right, witch!

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:20.500
Go home to your witch's nest!

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:28.270
You did your best, Aki.

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:30.210
Now let's go back together.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:39.960
There's a winner!  Yusei Fudo!

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:47.090
Aki Izayoi…

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:09.400
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:14.790
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:20.710
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:25.950
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:29.110
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:34.700
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.650 --> 00:22:41.860
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:41.990 --> 00:22:47.260
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:53.200
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:58.540
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.070 --> 00:23:04.600
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.740 --> 00:23:14.010
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
